{"unit_id":"Liujelly__dsh-memewiki#card-zh","repo":"Liujelly/dsh-memewiki","commit":"1d3f8266468823fe85290a016eadf3b8d1262de3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memewiki 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的中文网络梗、缩写和黑话词典插件。它通过 Harness 工具、系统提示上下文和设置页接入：模型可调用 search_meme_wiki 查询本地词条，聊天时也能自动识别可能的梗并预先注入词条。用户可以在设置页测试查词、开关自动预查与常驻用法提示、调整预查长度，并维护自己的黑话词条。插件默认只查本地数据库；启用在线补查后，本地未命中时会向 cnmeme.wiki 请求匹配词条。适合希望 DSH 理解中文网络流行语并按社群习惯接话的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:547-595","lib/index.js:644-679","client.js:344-356"]}
{"unit_id":"Liujelly__dsh-memewiki#card-en","repo":"Liujelly/dsh-memewiki","commit":"1d3f8266468823fe85290a016eadf3b8d1262de3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-memewiki adds a Chinese meme and slang dictionary to DSH. The model can look up local entries and preload matches as context. Its web settings page supports lookup tests and custom slang. Optional online lookup queries cnmeme.wiki.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:547-595","lib/index.js:644-679","client.js:344-356"]}
