{"unit_id":"Liujelly__dsh-memewiki#feature-1","repo":"Liujelly/dsh-memewiki","commit":"1d3f8266468823fe85290a016eadf3b8d1262de3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memewiki 的功能「梗词查询」：模型可调用 search_meme_wiki，按词名查询本地数据库并获得标签、用法和出处；未命中时明确返回未找到。启用 online 后还可向 cnmeme.wiki 补查。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:453-495","lib/index.js:547-581"]}
{"unit_id":"Liujelly__dsh-memewiki#feature-2","repo":"Liujelly/dsh-memewiki","commit":"1d3f8266468823fe85290a016eadf3b8d1262de3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memewiki 的功能「聊天预查注入」：新消息到来时提取可能的梗词，在本地词库中查找命中项，并把词条作为上下文交给模型，减少模型硬猜。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:597-679"]}
{"unit_id":"Liujelly__dsh-memewiki#feature-3","repo":"Liujelly/dsh-memewiki","commit":"1d3f8266468823fe85290a016eadf3b8d1262de3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memewiki 的功能「设置与自建黑话」：Web 设置页可切换预查、常驻提示和在线补查，调整预查词长，测试查词，并添加或删除自定义词条。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:681-765","client.js:8-24","client.js:250-341"]}
{"unit_id":"Liujelly__dsh-memewiki#caveat-1","repo":"Liujelly/dsh-memewiki","commit":"1d3f8266468823fe85290a016eadf3b8d1262de3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memewiki 使用前须知：在线补查默认关闭；打开后，未命中的查询词会发送到 cnmeme.wiki。日常本地查词不需要该网络请求。（见 lib/index.js:336-346、469-477）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:336-346","lib/index.js:469-477"]}
